---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import { Box } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto mb-5 md:mb-12 px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl mt-8 md:mt-24 pt-5 md:pt-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-lg">
                <h6 class="text-[13px] md:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    Industrial & Warehousing
                </h6>

                <div class="w-2.5 aspect-square rounded-full bg-[var(--primary-color)] mx-1.5"></div>

                <h6 class="text-[13px] md:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    54 <span class="text-gray-700 text-[10px] md:text-[13px]">Acres</span>
                </h6>

                <div class="w-2.5 aspect-square rounded-full bg-[var(--primary-color)] mx-1.5"></div>

                <h6 class="text-[13px] md:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    1.2 Mn. Sq. Ft. <span class="text-gray-700 text-[10px] md:text-[13px]">Buildable area</span>
                </h6>
            </span>
            <h1 class="font-bold text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl text-center">
                <span class="block">Why Our Park in Hosur</span> Powers Strategic Growth
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto mt-1.5">
                Located in Shoolagiri, our 54-acre Grade A industrial park offers compliant infrastructure, skilled workforce access, and proximity to major industrial and logistics hubs near Hosur.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full flex items-stretch justify-center gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-7">
            <div class="w-1/2 rounded-md overflow-hidden">
                <Image src="/images/upload/parks/chennai-redhills-warehouse.webp" alt="warehouse-redhills" width={530} height={360} class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" />
            </div>
            <div class="w-1/2 bg-white rounded-md px-7 py-5">
                <span class="w-fit flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 bg-[#f5f5f5] border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-lg">
                    <Box size={14} class="text-[var(--primary-color)]" />
                    <p class="text-[11px] md:text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-800">
                        Core Highlights
                    </p>
                </span>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-3.5">
                    <h4 class="md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold">
                        Global-Standard, Compliant Infrastructure
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 text-left px-auto mt-1.5">
                        The site is located in Shoolagiri and is well connected to Bangalore city. The park is planned as a single-phase Grade A industrial development spanning 54 acres. Shoolagiri/Hosur is approximately 40 km from Bengaluru and serves as a satellite industrial town to the city. This integrated logistics park will be developed to meet the requirements of Grade A tenants.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-3.5">
                    <h4 class="md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold">
                        Strategic Location with Seamless Access
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 text-left px-auto mt-1.5">
                        The site lies along National Highway 44 (Bengaluru–Chennai Highway) and is approximately 55 km from Bengaluru city center.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-3.5">
                    <h4 class="md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold">
                        Proven Ecosystem for Industrial Growth
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 text-left px-auto mt-1.5">
                        Hosur is a developed industrial area hosting several automotive, auto-ancillary, and manufacturing units. The site is 17 km from SIPCOT Industrial Area at Hosur and is in proximity to major companies such as Ashok Leyland, TVS Motors, TTK Prestige, Reckitt Benckiser, and Carborundum Universal, making it well-suited for industrial and warehousing tenants.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>